  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Assists - Global Humanitarian Specialists Deployment Program (2017-2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment bolsters Australia&apos;s ability to deploy civilian specialists to work with governments, multilateral agencies, and communities to prepare for, respond to, and recover from, the effects of disasters and conflict. The program responds to sudden onset and emerging humanitarian needs as they arise, with a focus on the Pacific, Asia, the Middle East, and Africa regions. Thematic priority areas include Gender, Disability and Localisation. Through a focus on Disaster Risk Reduction initiatives, adaptation to climate change is also supported.</narrative>
  </description>
